<title>UK: Cortecs Macritonin trials shows response.</title>
<headline>Cortecs Macritonin trials shows response.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Australian drugs firm Cortecs International said on Tuesday that the second and third phase of its trials on Macritonin have shown siginificant responses.</p>
<p>Macritonin is a drug to combat bone disease.</p>
</text>
